-- ===========================================================================
-- ecila's Hyprland config — single file
-- ===========================================================================
-- Loaded natively by Hyprland 0.56+ (this file replaces hyprland.conf).
-- Sections appear in load order; each maps 1:1 to a file from the old
-- multi-file layout (noted in each banner). The only external file is
-- noctalia.lua, which is regenerated by Noctalia — do not hand-edit it.
-- Switching user = `git checkout user/paquete` (each user has a branch).
-- Rollback to the old multi-file layout = `git checkout main`.
-- If this file ever feels too big, split sections into files for THIS user
-- only — there is no dynamic per-user dispatcher anymore.
-- ===========================================================================

